</title><link id="ctl00_Imports" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/CSS/Base/CSS/AllCSS.ashx?v=20101202qrwef&amp;t=RBX2" /><link id="ctl00_Link1" rel="icon" type="image/vnd.microsoft.icon" href="/favicon.ico" /><link rel="Stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/chat/css/party.css" /><link rel="Stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/chat/css/party_leader.css" /><link rel="Stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/chat/css/party_invite.css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Language" content="en-us" /><meta name="author" content="ROBLOX Corporation" /><meta id="ctl00_metadescription" name="description" content="UNSC Rescue Mission - Warthogs - Zombies, a Free Game by FNACC95 - ROBLOX (updated 8/9/2010 1:45:06 PM): IMPORTANT! READ DESCRIPTION! In this game, there are 4 teams. One team, the UNSC Troops, must search for any survivors in the surrounding area, fight any resistance, and bring the survivors back to the main base so that they can join the UNSC Troops by stepping on their respawn, just outside the main building. The other three teams must combat the zombies effectively and try to survive until they are rescued by the UNSC Troops, so that they may join them and aid them. Please report any glitches to me if there are any. Credits to the maker of the warthog, though I am not sure who the original creator was. Please be considerate when choosing to regen the warthogs. Thanks and enjoy the game." /><meta id="ctl00_metakeywords" name="keywords" content="virtual good UNSC Rescue Mission - Warthogs - Zombies, a Free Game by FNACC95 - ROBLOX (updated 8/9/2010 1:45:06 PM) items, ROBLOX UNSC Rescue Mission - Warthogs - Zombies, a Free Game by FNACC95 - ROBLOX (updated 8/9/2010 1:45:06 PM)" />

